      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sounds like a losing fight because it is—you're fighting a system that was never designed to let you win. But you don't have to keep playing by those rules; you can redefine what winning means for yourself, even if it's just a smaller, quieter life that feels like yours. The future doesn't have to be more of the same—it can be a slow, deliberate retreat from the battle, not a surrender, but a choice to stop bleeding for people who don't see your worth.",
